<title>UK: Rabobank sets 500 mln Dem 30-year zero-coupon bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets 500 mln Dem 30-year zero-coupon bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    28.OCT.26</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  13.403    PAY DATE    28.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.5 PCT   REOFFER   *12.978    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     *RECOMMENDED</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    FRFT/AMST PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMS US/UK/DE/NE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.075     SELL CONC  0.425</p>
<p> NOTES	RABOBANK INTERNATIONAL IS A JOINT LEAD</p>
<p>		SENIOR, UNSECURED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
